stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Creating : Bot calls Daytona.Create(snapshot)

    Creating --> Running : Sandbox ready\n(agent.sh / followup.sh starts)
    Creating --> CreateFailed : Daytona error\n(retried up to 3x with backoff)

    CreateFailed --> [*] : Bot emits error to user\nConveration row saved for retry

    state Running {
        [*] --> SetupClone
        SetupClone --> ClaudeRunning : git clone success\nClaude Code invoked
        SetupClone --> SetupFailed : clone / auth error
        ClaudeRunning --> PRCreated : Last line = PR URL
        ClaudeRunning --> AgentFailed : Wall/idle timeout\nor non-zero exit
    }

    Running --> Stopping : Bot calls sb.Stop()
    Stopping --> Archived : Bot calls sb.Archive()
    Archived --> Resuming : Follow-up request arrives\nBot calls sb.StartWithTimeout()

    Resuming --> Running : Sandbox warm again\n(≈ seconds from archive)
    Resuming --> ResumeFailed : DaytonaTimeoutError\nor 5xx

    ResumeFailed --> [*] : Bot emits "Sandbox slow to start"\nUser told to retry or open new chat

    Archived --> Archived : No follow-up\n(cost-efficient idle state)

    note right of Archived
        Archived sandboxes persist all files
        (repo checkout, git history).
        Follow-ups resume in seconds
        without re-cloning.
    end note

    note right of Creating
        Snapshot image pre-baked with:
        - Claude Code CLI
        - gh CLI (authenticated)
        - Go toolchain
        - Node.js / Python / etc.
        Env vars: SX_KEY (if set)
    end note

    note right of ClaudeRunning
        Timeout limits:
        - Wall clock: 45 min
        - Idle (no output): 15 min
        Heartbeat every 5 min to user
    end note
